  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FsqPTns/One-Summer-Block.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></h2>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一張冒險地圖，類似於 <em>IJAMinecraft</em> 的 <strong>OneBlock</strong> 地圖。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在這張地圖中，你將作為一個漂浮於虛空中的單一方塊出現。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你將不斷挖掘 <strong>夏日幸運方塊</strong>！祝你好運！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ypcDxRm/Summer-lucky-block.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"489\" height=\"275\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎來到 <em><strong>Lucky Summer OneBlock！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這款 Minecraft 地圖將帶你展開一段令人興奮且</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">充滿挑戰的冒險旅程，核心圍繞著一個 <em><strong>單一</strong></em> 的&nbsp;<strong>夏日&nbsp;</strong><em><strong>幸運方塊</strong></em>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">準備好體驗一場充滿 <strong>驚喜</strong>、<strong>危險</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以及 <strong>機會</strong> 的旅程吧！當你探索這個獨特且有限的世界時。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/K6kBFgG/2023-07-09-17-43-56.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"288\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\" width=\"1205\" height=\"56\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/82Bn5Sx/This-Map-requieres-the-addons.png\" width=\"894\" height=\"49\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><em>夏日幸運方塊</em>:</span><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/summer-lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/summer-lucky-block</a><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">點擊此處享有 25% 折扣</span></a></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a><br><br></h2>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>我的 Discord：</em></strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B9rysAEFGk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
